[00:20.86]1. Life in this world can be hard.
[00:26.78]Life in this world can bring tears and pain.
[00:32.70]Still ev’ry day I will say,
[00:36.98]“My life is not in vain.”
[00:43.02](Chorus)
[00:43.30]For God is not unrighteous,
[00:49.18]And he remembers the love I’ve shown.
[00:55.40]So he is ever near me;
[01:00.30]With Jehovah, I’m not alone.
[01:06.18]Yes, God is my provider
[01:11.16]and my protector down to the end.
[01:18.20]Yes, Jehovah is my Father,
[01:24.20]My God and Friend.
[01:52.08]2. Gone are the days of my youth;
[01:57.84]Days of calamity now are here.
[02:03.44]Still through the eyes of my faith,
[02:08.54]My hope is bright and clear.
[02:13.02](Chorus)
[02:13.68]For God is not unrighteous,
[02:18.84]And he remembers the love I’ve shown.
[02:24.80]So he is ever near me;
[02:30.78]With Jehovah, I’m not alone.
[02:36.02]Yes, God is my provider
[02:41.00]and my protector down to the end.
[02:48.84]Yes, Jehovah is my Father,
[02:55.06]My God and Friend.
